  "notes": "shadcn/ui-style admin (sidebar block, Geist font, ring-shadow hairline outlines). Warm off-white page background with white panels; single emerald green accent is used for the selected KPI tile outline, positive deltas (↗ arrows), the chart line and area fill, and the top-products progress bars. Previous-period comparison drawn as a dashed grey line. Pill-shaped (fully rounded) 'pending work' links ('36 orders to fulfill', '3 orders awaiting payment') with chevrons sit above the KPIs as quick-action shortcuts to filtered order views. KPI tiles are toggle buttons (aria-pressed) that swap the chart metric. Top products list rows: square thumbnail, name, revenue right-aligned, thin proportional green bar with units beneath. Sidebar nav groups use small muted section labels ('Store', 'Platform'); active item is a white rounded pill with green icon."
